        "Makes mediated reporting visible and rejects punishing reporters merely for bringing conflict to attention.",
        "First Corinthians reports name-based slogans around Paul, Apollos, Cephas, and Christ while appealing against divisions.",
        "Prevents reconstructing rigid parties or using unity language to silence a substantiated complaint.",
